OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome clear spells through the evening
OL,7,Fand overnight for Dundee and Fife.
OL,8,FCloudier in the north and west with a
OL,9,Ffew light showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FMostly dry with sunny
OL,12,Fspells in the morning, but the odd
OL,13,Flight shower possible at first. The
OL,14,Fodd afternoon shower before a band of
OL,15,Fheavy rain pushes east in evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
