OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright spells and showers Thursday,
OL,7,Fdriest in the east. Showers ease
OL,8,FFriday morning, becoming dry and
OL,9,Fbright, then rain spreads east later.
OL,10,FBright spells Saturday with just the
OL,11,Fodd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
